'' The editor scan over a 'derive text' type (RFC 0019 R6): the compiler-written ToText( ) has no
'' symbol, so the scan gives it a record of its own under the type, at the 'derive' line -- what
'' tkEdit's member list reads. A type that derives only 'equal' gets none.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-scan tests/api/src/scanderive.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: [1] function ToText as ustring  @0:3:5  parent=0
'' EXPECT-OUT: [2] type Plain  @0:6:6  parent=-1
'' EXPECT-OUT: symbols: 6
